{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117965","id":3462463236,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7OYP8E","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117965","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117965.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117965.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117965","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117965/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117965/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117965/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/75a35cc8998d5f7ae40666cead9f9dda0c4b3f48","number":117965,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Improve error message for static/non-static function conflicts","user":{"login":"Lidang-Jiang","id":119769478,"node_id":"U_kgDOByOJhg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119769478?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang","html_url":"https://github.com/Lidang-Jiang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #117912.\n\nWhen a child class defines a function with the same name as a parent's static function (or vice versa), the error messages were not specific enough about the static/non-static mismatch.\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. In `check_class_member_name_conflict`: When a member name conflicts with a parent class's static function, the error now says `The member \"X\" already exists in parent class Y as a static function.` instead of the generic `The member \"X\" already exists in parent class Y.`\n\n2. In `resolve_function_signature`: Split the validation into two cases:\n   - **Static mismatch**: Shows a specific error like `The function \"X\" is not static, but the parent function of the same name is static.`\n   - **Signature mismatch**: Shows the existing signature comparison error (unchanged behavior).\n\n<details>\n<summary>Before</summary>\n\n```\n# Case 1: Child non-static overrides parent static\nERROR at line 8: The function signature doesn't match the parent. Parent signature is \"my_function() -> void\".\n\n# Case 2: Variable overloads parent static function\nERROR at line 8: The member \"overload_me\" already exists in parent class A.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>After</summary>\n\n```\n# Case 1: Child non-static overrides parent static\nERROR at line 8: The function \"my_function\" is not static, but the parent function of the same name is static. A static function cannot be overridden with a non-static function.\n\n# Case 2: Child static overrides parent non-static\nERROR at line 8: The function \"my_function\" is static, but the parent function of the same name is not static. A non-static function cannot be overridden with a static function.\n\n# Case 3: Variable overloads parent static function\nERROR at line 8: The member \"overload_me\" already exists in parent class A as a static function.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n**Tests added:**\n- `override_static_function_with_non_static.gd/.out`\n- `override_non_static_function_with_static.gd/.out`\n- `variable_overloads_superclass_static_function.gd/.out`\n\n---\n\n**AI disclosure:** AI tooling (Claude Code) was used to assist with writing and reviewing the code. All modifications were reviewed and tested by the author.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-03-29T13:09:09Z","updated_at":"2026-04-06T10:08:54Z","closed_at":"2026-04-06T01:47:07Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a2590c9091ec6039440f8a155360634fb8ec81d3","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Lidang-Jiang:fix/static-function-error-message","ref":"fix/static-function-error-message","repo":{"id":1195231195,"node_id":"R_kgDORz3H2w","name":"godot","full_name":"Lidang-Jiang/godot","owner":{"login":"Lidang-Jiang","id":119769478,"node_id":"U_kgDOByOJhg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119769478?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang","html_url":"https://github.com/Lidang-Jiang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions